圆弧；红蓝表示负角度（逆时针），绿黑表示正角度（顺时针）。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"629ddd52-ca73-47f1-af1f-e3df3761c8c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"贝塞尔曲线"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2eece687-5b8d-469b-b3df-50870086e0eb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 SVG 中我们使用贝塞尔曲线来绘制任意的曲线，常见的贝塞尔曲线有二阶贝塞尔曲线和三阶贝塞尔曲线。一条贝塞尔曲线由三部分组成："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"ba611fe8-daa3-4ac4-9b89-a74ee36a0eb9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d168e843-cf8a-4357-938d-2c3e52011e1d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c010786-f75c-4b42-81b6-369b9098fabd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"起点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"26d3129c-a8f3-4cb9-9e18-c4805e79211b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"02894ad6-af7f-4177-8cb2-5bea242e9018","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"控制点"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7b1d99cd-88c1-4d29-9266-820617825338","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8599fdc5-e932-4b69-b5a7-f6759b75380f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"终点"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"15aaca81-6d5b-4701-bf19-9afc2b1439a0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"二阶贝塞尔曲线有一个控制点，而三阶贝塞尔曲线有两个控制点，因此二阶贝塞尔曲线需要指定两个坐标（控制点坐标和终点坐标，起点不用指定），三阶贝塞尔曲线需要指定三个坐标（两个控制点，一个终点）。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d99bef34-92b4-446f-9365-a1dc03e59ed4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制二阶贝塞尔曲线的指令是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Q(q)"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"b4c90d80-aced-4834-a5d9-d6679b0939d0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d15edfd8-ef68-4bec-90e8-2604f62a0eef","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <path d=\"M 10,10 Q 50,50 90,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" />\n  <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ed556a\" />\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#bc84a8\" />\n  <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2486b9\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"59cc76f0-7070-47d3-833e-1a2215806978","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <path d=\"M 10,10 Q 50,50 90,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" />\n  <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ed556a\" />\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#bc84a8\" />\n  <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2486b9\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"5ba0d200-bcdf-41e6-90c5-ae826acd80d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9238a80f-9a4c-49c9-8b12-71216e0487d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"贝塞尔曲线有一个特点，起点与第一个控制点的连线与曲线相切，终点与最后一个控制点的连线与曲线相切（对于任意阶数的贝塞尔曲线均成立）"}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"100\" height=\"100\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n  <path d=\"M 10,10 Q 50,50 90,10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" />\n  <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ed556a\" />\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#bc84a8\" />\n  <circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2486b9\" />\n  <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-dasharray=\"2\" />\n  <line x1=\"90\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"red\" stroke-dasharray=\"2\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"b9f93df0-f0fc-429d-958f-bb27cc1f5d17","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3041a286-f16b-42a0-8aab-2e27a2a31060","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 C(c) 指令来绘制三阶贝塞尔曲线，需要指定两个控制点和一个终点"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"html","uuid":"09d4c153-6b5f-44c5-aaff-51f74deea678","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"76bf0d90-1626-43ef-a761-a5198abefd69","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"<svg width=\"200\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\">\n  <path d=\"M 10,20 C 50,80 100,10 160 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" />\n  <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"20\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ed556a\" />\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"80\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#bc84a8\" />\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2486b9\" />\n  <circle cx=\"160\" cy=\"50\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1a66ff\" />\n</svg>","collabId":"396fa045-5795-490c-9336-03a971fbbe75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"html-block","tauContract":"ae642145aa1ba86b2ad23b93d4b1f24ed47731812964ef66e868fa9fd81f6554","html":"<svg width=\"200\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 120\">\n  <path d=\"M 10,20 C 50,80 100,10 160 50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"gray\" />\n  <circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"20\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#ed556a\" />\n  <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"80\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#bc84a8\" />\n  <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#2